5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We need to be decisive this year. I suggest we look into the logistics and the social dynamics of our previous trips to avoid past mistakes.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I agree, dear. It would be lovely to ensure the financial side is handled fairly for everyone this time around.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I want to know about the bathrooms and when we have to eat. I don't like being rushed.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I am concerned about the travel time. I would like to see how much of our week is spent in transit.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I'd like to get a clear picture of the total costs. It's easier if we know the full amount upfront.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, if you check the travel, perhaps I can look into how we spent our time last year to see why it felt off.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,That sounds wise. I will look into how the bills were split last time to see if we can improve it.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Midori, can you help me find out about the room arrangements? I don't like sleeping in one big room.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I will look into the ferry and train schedules.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I can do that, Minato. I'll also check the all-in rates versus separate meals.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I'll also check the time we spent alone during the shared-house trip. It's important for our balance.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will also look into the pricing of those offshore houses.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I'll check the bathing hours too.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I'll look into the local transport options for the different areas.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,I'll check the valley inn rates compared to city beds.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
