33,2,,status,Shizue,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
34,2,,status,Mizuki,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,It seems our previous trips suffered from either too much isolation or a total lack of privacy. We need a middle ground.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,I've found that renting a whole building is much fairer for the budget than booking separate rooms.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,"The inn sounds strict with mealtimes, and the island house only has one bathroom. That sounds stressful.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The island trip takes two whole days just for travel. The spa valley is much closer by train.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,The city is the most expensive and unpredictable. The inn has a set price that includes meals.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Minato, if the island house is too crowded, maybe the city or the inn is better?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, does the all-in rate at the inn feel fair, or does it penalize light eaters?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,I don't like the idea of everyone in one room on futons. I need a door.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"The city has the best transport, but the spa valley is a good compromise on travel time.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shizue, the all-in rate is the same for everyone, regardless of how much they eat.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"If we go to the city, we might end up spending the whole time separately again, which was a problem last year.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"A single bill for a house is very tidy, but we must consider Minato's comfort.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,"I think the city is better for the bathroom situation, but I'm worried about being alone.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,I really want to avoid the ferry. Two days of travel is too much.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,The city beds are very pricey and meals are extra. The inn is more predictable.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,"We have three clear options: the Hot Spring Town, the Island, or the City.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,Let's weigh the fairness of the cost against the comfort of the group.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,I just want to be able to sleep and wash in peace.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,I vote for the shortest travel time.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Midori,,I prefer the option where the cost is fixed and clear.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
