60,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,The city offers privacy but risks isolation. The inn offers togetherness but lacks privacy. The island is too far.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"The island house is the most financially equitable, but the bathroom situation is poor.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minato,,I can't do the island bathroom or the inn's shared room. I prefer the city.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,The city or the inn are both fine for travel. I'll lean toward the city for the ease of movement.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Midori,,The city is too expensive and the costs are fragmented. I prefer the Hot Spring Town.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Midori, the inn's shared room might be too much for some of us. @Minato, are you sure about the city?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"I think the Hot Spring Town is a lovely compromise, provided we can handle the rooming.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minato,,I really don't like the futons in one room. I'll stick with the city.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Minato. The city is efficient.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Midori,,But the city is so expensive! The inn is a package deal.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I think the city is the safest bet for our mental health, even if it's less ""together.""","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"If the majority prefers the city, I will support it for the sake of harmony.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minato,,"Yes, the city please.","{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,City it is for me.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Midori,,"I'm worried about the budget, but I won't stand in the way of everyone's comfort.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Mizuki,,It seems we are leaning heavily toward the city.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I am happy to go along with the group.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Minato,,Me too.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Midori,,"I'll agree, but let's plan the budget carefully.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
